id: pm-gantt-chart-chso
title: jscpd 5.3.2 detects two duplicate pairs and blocks dependency PR #122
description: The jscpd 5.3.2 update on PR #122 makes the zero-duplication CI gate fail on duplicated entry guard code and a JSON-export test payload. Consolidate the production guard and remove redundant test work without relaxing the zero threshold.
type: Issue
status: blocked
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T11:47:20.305Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-03T00:08:35.012Z"
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "jscpd 5.3.2 duplication gate reports zero clone pairs at its existing zero threshold; docstring, typecheck, full test and coverage gates pass; exact pushed-head CI and substantive reviewer findings are resolved"
repro_steps: Run npm run duplication on PR #122 head 6ee58d2; see GitHub Actions run 36257622444.
expected_result: The dependency PR passes the unchanged zero-duplication gate and package release checks.
actual_result: Both Node CI jobs fail with two clone pairs totaling nine duplicated lines.
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T23:58:20.026Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed PR #122 from 76df68adbc0e9ad5d98d4ef4cc7327a1faa73eb0. Rebase onto current main yields 76df68adbc0e9ad5d98d4ef4cc7327a1faa73eb0. All existing bot artifacts and restart-era owner replies inspected; no new actionable finding. Preserve earlier fixes and technical refusals. Verifying unchanged CI gates under the shared heavy lock; no merge, release or closure."
  "2026-10-03T00:04:24.496Z",codex-sol-land,"Newest unpublished linked-test metadata hash was re-anchored using pinned project CLI after dry-run verification. Fifteen existing events and their operation/provenance payloads were retained, ten previously published lines remain byte-identical, and an audit marker was appended. No test assertion, gate, threshold or provenance normalization changed. The before-repair evidence is retained in the restart receipt directory."
  "2026-10-03T00:08:34.016Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed verification: npm ci, current-base rebase, fresh committed-dist comparison, strict local tracker health with required merge drivers, npm run release:check, and bun install --no-save all passed. Full gate: 230 tests, 230 pass, 0 skips; configured coverage thresholds unchanged. PM-linked test/handler.test.ts passed. Earlier findings and technical refusals retained; no new source fix was needed in this restart. Exact pushed-head CI and substantive reviewer availability remain separate checks; no merge, release, publication or item closure."
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T11:50:41.908Z",codex,"At Dependabot head 6ee58d2, both Node CI jobs failed at the unchanged zero-duplication gate: 9 duplicated lines in two clone pairs. Reused the existing canonical main-invocation guard and removed a second JSON render in the critical-path test. With jscpd 5.3.2 installed from this branch lockfile, duplication reports 0/9181 lines across 27 sources and zero clone pairs. Local npm run release:check passed, including typecheck, lint, docstrings (60 declarations), package coverage gate, production audit, packed npm/Bun/minimum-host acceptance, changelog, and release-attestation checks. Packed acceptance currently names PM hosts 2026.9.23 and 2026.8.20; latest 2026.9.29 acceptance and exact pushed-head CI/reviews remain separate work."
  "2026-09-29T11:53:41.012Z",codex,"Additional packed latest-host acceptance on 2026-09-29: npm pack of candidate 1ffb65a installed into fresh synthetic npm/Node and Bun 1.3.5 Git projects alongside published @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.9.29. In both, npx/bunx initialized the tracker, created a real task, installed the tarball, rendered JSON Gantt output, exported the fixture, and passed pm health --strict-exit with zero warnings. The Bun invocation used bunx --no-install (Node runtime); upstream pm-cli#1349 remains open for bunx --bun merge-driver drift. Exact-head GitHub Node 22.18 and 26 tests, CodeQL, Hound and the old Sourcery status passed; a new Sourcery review request returned review-budget limit and CodeRabbit skipped this Dependabot-authored PR. Greptile and Gemini substantive replies remain pending."
  "2026-09-29T12:12:38.391Z",codex,"PM-linked release:check initially failed because the isolated packed acceptance inherited PM_PATH from the linked-test sandbox and pm init selected that ancestor tracker. Cleared PM_PATH and source-coordinate environment variables for fresh subprocesses; the linked test now runs in tracker context and passed the complete release:check gate at 2026-09-29 12:12 UTC. This fixes the package acceptance harness; the earlier direct gate and exact-head CI are separate evidence. Publication remains blocked by pm-gantt-chart-8mkl / GitHub #71 public-history privacy review."
